<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The analysis shows that digital marketing investment strongly correlates with increased GMV and order volume for mass-market products, making it a high-impact channel. Unlike TV advertising, digital spend delivers consistent returns, especially in peak months like month 10, where a spike in investment directly drives record-high sales. To sustain and amplify growth, scaling digital investment strategically while optimizing spend efficiency can maximize revenue impact in the mass-market segment.)
/E (The analysis shows that digital marketing investment strongly correlates with increased GMV and order volume for mass-market products, making it a high-impact channel. Unlike TV advertising, digital spend delivers consistent returns, especially in peak months like month 10, where a spike in investment directly drives record-high sales. To sustain and amplify growth, scaling digital investment strategically while optimizing spend efficiency can maximize revenue impact in the mass-market segment.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
